5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:15,960
Then, along the western horizon, a
faint crimson glow begins to pulse above

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
the pines.

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,700
A low rumble builds in the distance,
like a distant freight train rolling

8
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,940
