between 1200 and 2500 lives.

94
00:05:43,980 --> 00:05:48,360
Across Lake Michigan that same night,
flames also leveled Holland, battered

95
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:51,760
Manistee, and scorched Michigan's
thumb near Port Huron.

96
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:55,120
Why then did the world hear
almost nothing about Peshtigo?

97
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:02,420
The answer came down to one
simple piece of 1871 technology,

98
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:04,140
