110
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:43,240
When news finally reached
eastern newspapers,

111
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,540
it appeared as a brief footnote
beneath giant headlines about Chicago's

112
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:48,580
rebuilding.

113
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:52,820
Chicago rose from the ashes with strict
brick -and -stone fire codes, steel

114
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:56,780
-framed skyscrapers, and the
dazzling 1893 World's Fair.

115
00:06:57,760 --> 00:07:01,680
Peshtigo rebuilt quietly on the banks
of its river, carrying a grief that

116
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,540
never faded for the families who survived.

117
